# Coleção de requisições (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client).
# Suba a stack com `make up` (ou `npm run dev` em aggregator/ com os mocks rodando).
@base = http://localhost:8000
@date = 2026-12-14

### 1. Busca de sucesso
POST {{base}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: demo-001

{ "origin": "GRU", "destination": "GIG", "date": "{{date}}" }

### 2. Mesma busca (cache hit → meta.cached = true; IATA é normalizado)
POST {{base}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin": "gru", "destination": "gig", "date": "{{date}}" }

### 3. Falha parcial: rode `make chaos` antes e repita algumas vezes (meta.partial = true)
POST {{base}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin": "CGH", "destination": "SDU", "date": "{{date}}" }

### 4. Validação: todos os erros de uma vez (400 Problem Details)
POST {{base}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin": "XX", "destination": "GIG", "date": "2020-01-01" }

### 5. Origem = destino (400)
POST {{base}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin": "GRU", "destination": "GRU", "date": "{{date}}" }

### 6. Liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live
